      "sequence": 3813,
      "chapter_label": "NUM 5",
      "verse_label": "20",
      "locator": {
        "book": "NUM",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 20
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "But if you have gone astray, being under your husband’s authority, and if you are defiled, and some man has lain with you besides your husband—”",
      "ko": "그러나 네가 네 남편을 두고 실행하여 더럽혀서 네 남편 아닌 사람과 동침하였으면",
      "source_text_hash": "74ee4a87c8698cd57ccbb2e0f5142b0aafd27b2a55195ccc3fd06dbd7d4d1952",
      "translation_text_hash": "1ca7f292d8d8704458c6541c443658e377d34ee2d82bd3b83b721ec0eaeb4de4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러나 네가 네 남편을 두고 실행하여 더럽혀서 네 남편 아닌 사람과 동침하였으면"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1ca7f292d8d8704458c6541c443658e377d34ee2d82bd3b83b721ec0eaeb4de4"
      ]
